id=hy300tweaks
name=HY300 Ultra (H726) Post-Root Tweaks
version=v1.0
versionCode=1
author=hoangphi01
description=Neutralizes the /system/xbin/hotacksu setuid-root backdoor (bind-mounts an empty 000 file over it) and brings a custom launcher forward at boot (stock firmware hard-forces com.htc.magcubicos as HOME). Edit the launcher package in service.sh before installing.
